00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:25.970
at some point.

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:28.240
Okay, Machine Gun Kelly, you're next.

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:29.480
Wine, beer whiskey.

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:33.340
Pete Davidson, Dave
Chappelle, Celine Dion,

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:35.158
