Christmas at his mom's house.

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:28.940
The weirdest two days in my life.

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:31.530
- I love your life.
This should be a movie.

00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:32.860
Even the fact that you ended up

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:35.317
